          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 134,
          "start": 428.91,
          "end": 430.75,
          "en": "Now you might remember",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 135,
          "start": 430.75,
          "end": 435.12,
          "en": "that there was this special behavior of Link",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 136,
          "start": 435.12,
          "end": 440.12,
          "en": "when the child you passed to it was not plain text.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 137,
          "start": 440.54,
          "end": 442.76,
          "en": "If you pass your own component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 138,
          "start": 442.76,
          "end": 446.49,
          "en": "or any other HTML content to a link,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 139,
          "start": 446.49,
          "end": 450.9,
          "en": "Link will not render an anchor tag by default.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 140,
          "start": 450.9,
          "end": 455.2,
          "en": "It only does that if you just pass plain text to it.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 141,
          "start": 455.2,
          "end": 457.75,
          "en": "If you pass anything else than plain text,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 142,
          "start": 457.75,
          "end": 460.88,
          "en": "the link will not render an anchor tag for you,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 143,
          "start": 460.88,
          "end": 462.21,
          "en": "so in order to get that,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 144,
          "start": 462.21,
          "end": 466.13,
          "en": "you should then bring your own anchor tag, like this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 145,
          "start": 466.13,
          "end": 469.23,
          "en": "You don't need to add ref on that anchor tag.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 146,
          "start": 469.23,
          "end": 470.93,
          "en": "Link will do that for you.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 147,
          "start": 470.93,
          "end": 473.26,
          "en": "It will pass the ref set on Link",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 148,
          "start": 473.26,
          "end": 477.5,
          "en": "to the direct child of Link, which is an anchor tag now.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 149,
          "start": 477.5,
          "end": 479.26,
          "en": "So it will do that for you,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 150,
          "start": 479.26,
          "end": 482.23,
          "en": "but you have to add the anchor tag element",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 151,
          "start": 482.23,
          "end": 485.453,
          "en": "to tell Link that it should render an anchor tag.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 152,
          "start": 486.29,
          "end": 491.08,
          "en": "This is not a bug or some inconsistency, but this exists.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 153,
          "start": 491.08,
          "end": 494.2,
          "en": "This feature exists to make sure",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 154,
          "start": 494.2,
          "end": 497.3,
          "en": "that you can turn any element into a link,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 155,
          "start": 497.3,
          "end": 500.59,
          "en": "a div, a button, whatever you want,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 156,
          "start": 500.59,
          "end": 502.77,
          "en": "but here we want an anchor tag still,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 157,
          "start": 502.77,
          "end": 507.14,
          "en": "so I will add my own anchor tag wrapped around my logo,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 158,
          "start": 507.14,
          "end": 508.96,
          "en": "and speaking of the logo,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 159,
